    "category": "Indicator",
    "type_designations": ["WE2111"],
    "description": "WE2111 digital indicator designed to be used as part of a single/dual range/interval, Class III non-automatic weighing instrument. Self-indicating, DC or mains powered. Features: ABS plastic enclosure, six-digit LED display, five function keys, weighing status, multiple range/interval status, connections and ports at the rear. Devices: extended indicating device, printing device, totalising device, initial zero setting device, zero tracking device, semi-automatic zero setting device, tare setting device (semi-automatic, additive and subtractive), preset tare device, multi-range device, multi-interval device, lb/kg switching device, gross/net switching device, calibration device, piece counting device, fault handling device, display test device (on power up), alibi memory device, zero indicator, indication of stable equilibrium. Interfaces: 6-wire load cell connection, DC voltage input, 2x RS-232, RS-485, control inputs/outputs, 2x USB (host and slave), 2x UARTS, 2x IIC (optional accessory), Ethernet. Model WE2111 is compatible with the C510 model as detailed in the associated test reports."
